<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Thursday that Toy Biz Inc, Marvel Entertainment Group Inc and Echlin Inc were not available for after-hours trading for news.</p>
<p>Oneita Industries Inc, Corimon SACA and Buenos Aires Embotelladora SA were also not available, it added.</p>
